.TH urlmenu-list 1  "list " 
.SH NAME
urlmenu\-list \- List detected targets with their ids and commands
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBurlmenu list\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List detected targets with their ids and commands
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print what would run as JSON instead of running it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
